    "detailed_description": "<strong>If you want Cine Tracer (original) and Cine Tracer 2, purchase Cine Tracer.</strong><br><br>Cine Tracer 2 is a virtual filmmaking sandbox that allows filmmakers to visualize short films, commercials, and feature films.  The game has a strong first person framework built from scratch in Unreal Engine 5 that takes advantage of new lighting technology like Lumen Global Illumination and Reflections.  The system has also been designed to work well with both gamepad/controller and mouse and keyboard.<br><br>Included is a single camera dolly system, a small lighting library, and two locations.  The first location is a Gas Station that uses the new Sun, Sky, and Clouds system.  The second location is a Warehouse Stage with a pre built 3 wall White Cyc and pre designed lighting grid.<br><br>The virtual actors are made with MetaHumans 2.0 and offer a wide range of hair options.  There is small selection of clothing and and actors poses.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>If you want Cine Tracer (original) and Cine Tracer 2, purchase Cine Tracer.</strong><br><br>Cine Tracer 2 is a virtual filmmaking sandbox that allows filmmakers to visualize short films, commercials, and feature films.  The game has a strong first person framework built from scratch in Unreal Engine 5 that takes advantage of new lighting technology like Lumen Global Illumination and Reflections.  The system has also been designed to work well with both gamepad/controller and mouse and keyboard.<br><br>Included is a single camera dolly system, a small lighting library, and two locations.  The first location is a Gas Station that uses the new Sun, Sky, and Clouds system.  The second location is a Warehouse Stage with a pre built 3 wall White Cyc and pre designed lighting grid.<br><br>The virtual actors are made with MetaHumans 2.0 and offer a wide range of hair options.  There is small selection of clothing and and actors poses.",
    "short_description": "Cine Tracer 2 is a cinematography visualization app used for pre-production for live action productions.",
